<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter upgraded Advanced Micro Devices Inc to strong buy from outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- After Monday's market close the company posted better-than-expected first quarter results.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/2 to 44-1/2 in composite trading.</p>
</text>
